Set `web.output` to `server` in your project's [app config](/versions/latest/config/app/) to enable server rendering:

```json app.json
{
  "expo": {
    /* @hide ... */
    /* @end */
    "web": {
      "output": "server"
    },
    "plugins": ["expo-router"]
  }
}
```



